eason: Playing H6 creates an immediate 4-in-a-row threat, forcing Black to block at H5. This move allows White to maintain the initiative and places a strategic stone at H6 that aligns with I7, establishing a new, open diagonal line for a subsequent winning attack.\n\nAnswer: {"col": "H", "row": 6}'}
